# The private test-asset set: what tools/ci/make-test-assets-repo.sh copies into the PRIVATE repository
# (docs/development/gpu-ci-private-assets.md). One path or glob per line, relative to assets/.
#
# Measured, not guessed: every file the test binaries actually OPENED under assets/ on 2026-09-28, traced
# with a DYLD open()/fopen() interposer while running (a) the whole GPU suite, avgen_render_tests, 549
# cases, and (b) the 280 avgen_tests cases a hosted runner skips or fails for want of an asset. Tracked
# files are left out (the public repository has them), and so are assets/audio/*.wav: CI regenerates
# them (tools/ci/generate-audio.sh). Not included, deliberately: ~/Desktop/Rebuild.mp3 and
# ~/Desktop/MP3/bass.mp3 (copyrighted songs; the owner's decision), and the motion packs 17 cases need
# that are not on the owner's machine either (retargeted 100STYLE, the augmented scout pack).
#
# Tier 1, the GPU suite: 63 files, 64.7 MB. Tier 2 adds what the Glowmere-tier CPU cases need:
# 139 files, 195.8 MB, of which the Tree of Life island meshes are most.
# Re-measure after changing the suites: the trace recipe is in docs/qa-pass/ci.md.

